      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T07:06:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, this bulk of this change is still important for generating the correct pointer type when we pass textures/samplers/combined-samplers to helper functions. We need this for both split and combined samplers and to make Tint\u0027s SPIR-V reader happy by matching glslang.\n\nThe part I\u0027m going to abandon is the bit that disallows OpSampledImage-type uniforms and instead apply the same rule to them too (always pass them to user-defined functions as a UniformConstant pointer).",
      "parentUuid": "3ab7d68a_029b18fd",
      "revId": "ee6328615d7b6f5a0e25c9d6a968e1a702736641",
